<% pageTitle = 'Refund Policy' %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
    <h2>Refund Policy</h2>
    <p>Because every artwork is custom hand-made specifically for you, orders are generally not eligible for a refund once production has started.</p>
    <p>Before your artwork is started, you'll be asked to approve your reference photo, size, and style. If you cancel before production begins, any advance paid is refunded minus any payment gateway charges already incurred.</p>
    <p>Once you've approved the finished artwork photo/video and made the balance payment, the order is considered complete and is not eligible for a refund on the basis of personal preference (for example, not liking the final look after approving it).</p>
    <p>If an artwork arrives damaged in transit, or there is a genuine quality issue that doesn't match what you approved, please contact us within 48 hours of delivery with photos of the issue, and we'll work with you on a repaint, replacement, or partial refund as appropriate.</p>
    <p>Refunds, when approved, are processed back to the original payment method and can take a few business days to reflect, depending on your bank or payment provider.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
